{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11203130","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11203130","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1120313001:1":{"text":"Strange... Did this boy run afoul of anyone recently? Perhaps another member of the clan?","source_cn":"奇怪？这孩子最近有得罪过什么人吗？或者是有什么仇家之类的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFFFDD2BE2E62557","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120313002:1":{"text":"I... I don't think so? Everyone in the Uru Clan gets along well with each other...","source_cn":"没有……吧？在我们乌尔氏族，大家相处的都挺好的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x585508D4325653E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120313003:1":{"text":"Hmm... did he eat anything questionable in the last few days?","source_cn":"嗯……那她这几天有没有吃什么乱七八糟的东西？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5FDBF94A709A598","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120313004:1":{"text":"I can't say for sure... After all, children randomly eat anything they pick up from the ground.","source_cn":"这个……我不太确定。你知道的，小孩子经常容易把奇怪的东...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0BE5E0A6778EDB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120313005:1":{"text":"Yes, you have a point. Meerky and the others eat anything they pick up when they're hungry. They even get so upset when I stop them...","source_cn":"啊呀，说的也是，蒙蒙他们要是肚子饿了，什么都能往嘴里塞...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFA3B179D1636EA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120313006:1":{"text":"Ahem, sorry about that! Now, my professional diagnosis is that this poor child's symptoms are the result of poisoning.","source_cn":"咳，不好意思！总之根据我的经验来看，这孩子的症状应该都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x379E297EBEB168FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120313007:1":{"text":"P-Poisoning?! I knew it wasn't just a cold...","source_cn":"中、中毒？！果然不是普通的生病嘛……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5FCAF1A9536C1CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1120313007":{"text":"P-Poisoning?! I knew it wasn't just a cold...","source_cn":"中、中毒？！果然不是普通的生病嘛……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5FCAF1A9536C1CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120313008:1":{"text":"I don't think so. After all, the Uru Clan is too distant from the other clans for them to easily poison the dwellers here.","source_cn":"看着不像，毕竟乌尔氏族远离其他氏族，应该不会是有人蓄意投毒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EFBB7B59612ED1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1120313010:1":{"text":"T-then what should we do? Find whatever it is that made him sick? It's been so long though...","source_cn":"那、那我们该怎么办？找到她之前吃的东西吗？但是已经过去...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDA5E0407B64E5C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1120313011:1":{"text":"Don't worry. I've seen this type of poisoning before, and I know exactly how to treat it.","source_cn":"放心，她中的毒我见过，而且也知道解药配方。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA0D49B004F8C777","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1120313012:1":{"text":"Here you go! Just gather the herbs on this list, and I can whip up a remedy for him.","source_cn":"喏，就是这个方子。你们只要按照方子上说的收集来草药就可以了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38F19A55CC5DBC0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1120313013:1":{"text":"Wait... Beasthoofs...?","source_cn":"等等，这些草药好像有点眼熟……兽蹄草……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2DE834C49E8234D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1120313014:1":{"text":"I gave that to him before, but it didn't have any effect!","source_cn":"兽蹄草我之前都给她用过！但是完全没有奏效……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA494515C4E2704AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1120313015:1":{"text":"...Well I have a secret formula that requires it!","source_cn":"……我有独家秘方！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E2397E2FD1A7892","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1120313016:1":{"text":"But...","source_cn":"可是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF675A5E894265F38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1120313017:1":{"text":"Now no more dilly-dallying! Just trust me and go!","source_cn":"你就别管这么多了，相信我就行！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0EA824775ABAC965","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1120313018:1":{"text":"After all, I saved you from your poisoning back at the Warsong Festival, remember?","source_cn":"之前在战歌节上，你中的毒不也是我帮你解的嘛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x140561E30C6C7048","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1120313019:1":{"text":"On my honor, I, Smokey, will save this child so long as you bring me every one of those herbs!","source_cn":"我阿熏在这里给你打包票，只要你们能给我找来这些药材，我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC32D04250B5AFF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1120313020:0":{"text":"I'll watch over him, so get going for now!","source_cn":"我先去照顾她了，你们快去快回！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B20C0FE3C33A5E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1120313021:0":{"text":"Something about Smokey isn't right...","source_cn":"阿熏，他……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57FAE73BBC1DD090","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:25:1120313021":{"text":"Something about Smokey isn't right...","source_cn":"阿熏，他……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57FAE73BBC1DD090","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1120313022:1":{"text":"I agree, but right now... all we can do is trust him.","source_cn":"嗯，我也这么觉得。但是现在……我们也只能相信他了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5FDA85265EFE382C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1120313024:1":{"text":"...You two are right! I shouldn't get carried away with my thoughts.","source_cn":"……你们说的没错！是我关心则乱了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB624EEF4978BA2AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1120313025:1":{"text":"Right now, we have to find more beasthoofs... Come with me, everyone!","source_cn":"当务之急还是赶快找来兽蹄草……大家跟我来吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79181CC388D50962","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:25:0:1":{"text":"Smokey seems suspicious.","source_cn":"阿熏很可疑","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3FEA14A071935169","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Smokey seems suspicious.","female":"Smokey seems suspicious.","variant_male_record_index":"63848","variant_female_record_index":"63849","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1120313023:1":{"text":"As suspicious as he is, we really don't have much of a choice.","source_cn":"虽然他很可疑，但我们也只有相信他了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57DFD3B1AFA1CE41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:25:1:2":{"text":"We should trust him.","source_cn":"先相信阿熏吧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE195AB114257DDD9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"We should trust him.","female":"We should trust him.","variant_male_record_index":"63850","variant_female_record_index":"63851","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:0:1":{"text":"Could someone have poisoned him?","source_cn":"有人投毒吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCC3D5C1263BBD0FC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Could someone have poisoned him?","female":"Could someone have poisoned him?","variant_male_record_index":"63844","variant_female_record_index":"63845","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1120313009:1":{"text":"My thoughts exactly.","source_cn":"不错，我也是这么推测的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD2705C329FB75E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:1:2":{"text":"Did he eat something wrong?","source_cn":"是不是吃了不该吃的东西","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFA5B46B45BCD1BF4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Did he eat something wrong?","female":"Did he eat something wrong?","variant_male_record_index":"63846","variant_female_record_index":"63847","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:阿熏":{"text":"Smokey","source":"阿熏","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"Alsa","source":"阿尔萨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索恩":{"text":"Soren","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":32,"localized_text_count":31,"speaker_count":3}}